[h1]TECZ | VEHICLES[/h1]
[b]OFFICIAL VEHICLE MODPACK • ROLEPLAY | PVE | HARDCORE[/b]

The roads of Chernarus tell their own stories.

[b]TECZ Vehicles[/b] brings together multiple vehicle content packs for the TECZ DayZ server. From everyday travel to longer expeditions through a dangerous world, this collection helps shape the vehicle variety available in our survival roleplay experience.

This Workshop item is a [b]server-specific compilation[/b]. Individual vehicles, availability, prices and gameplay configurations are determined by TECZ.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TecPlayBR/DayZ/main/TECZ/SteamWorkshop/assets/01-about.jpg[/img]
[h2]ABOUT TECZ VEHICLES[/h2]

Our goal is to keep vehicle-related content organized in one consistent package for the server, making updates and Workshop management easier for the community.

[b]Included vehicle collections[/b]
[list]
[*] 4KBOSS Car Pack
[*] Alex Fortune Car Pack
[*] Car Pack
[*] Hoonicorn Car Pack
[*] Meru Car Pack
[*] Namanths Car Pack
[/list]

[b]Important:[/b] The names above reflect the six source folders in the current package inventory. They do not represent a verified list of individual vehicle models or a guarantee that every vehicle is available for spawning, purchase or use on the live server.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TecPlayBR/DayZ/main/TECZ/SteamWorkshop/assets/02-screenshots.jpg[/img]
[h2]VEHICLE SHOWCASE[/h2]

Official in-game screenshots will be added to this Workshop item's gallery as the vehicles are tested and prepared for TECZ.

The gallery will showcase real vehicles from the package. Actual availability and balancing may change during development.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TecPlayBR/DayZ/main/TECZ/SteamWorkshop/assets/03-installation.jpg[/img]
[h2]INSTALLATION & REQUIREMENTS[/h2]

[list]
[*] Subscribe to this Workshop item when it is listed as a requirement for TECZ.
[*] Launch DayZ through the official launcher and let it load all Workshop dependencies required by the server.
[*] Keep your mods updated before connecting.
[*] If you need assistance with installation or loading errors, contact the official TECZ Discord.
[/list]

[b]Server status:[/b] Season 1 is in development. Package content and configurations may be updated as testing continues.

